Package: affirmoTM
Title: Disease-State Transition Model for the AFFIRMO iABC Pathway Cost-Effectiveness Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rony Lizzy", "Sunny", email = "ronylizsunny@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Chris", "Kypridemos", role = "aut")
  )
Description: An annual-cycle disease-state transition model for adults aged 65
    and over with atrial fibrillation and multimorbidity, ported as a
    standalone package from the transition model of the IMPACTaf model.
    It compares the AFFIRMO integrated ABC (iABC) pathway with usual care
    using user-supplied transition probabilities, costs and utilities, and
    reports incremental cost-effectiveness ratios and the cost-effectiveness
    plane.
